1. Use memoization to avoid unnecessary API calls. Memoize the `prompts` query result and only update it when needed. This can be done using the `useMemo` hook in React Query.

```jsx
const memoizedPrompts = useMemo(() => {
  const sortedPrompts = prompts.data?.sort((a, b) =>
